# data.gov.in domain

Detail: `.cursor/docs/domain-data-gov-in.md`

## Rules

- API key: `DATA_GOV_IN_API_KEY` in `.env` / systemd only — never in `ui/`
- Prefer `format=json` via `DataGovInClient`
- One **`service/datagov/*DatasetService`** per resource UUID with its own cleanup/marshalling
- Register new datasets in `DatasetDataService` + `DatasetCatalogService`
- Normalize state names for `@svg-maps/india` (see `McaCompanyMasterDatasetService`)

## MCA reference dataset

- UUID: `4dbe5667-7b6b-41d7-82af-211562424d9a`
- Endpoint: `GET /api/datasets/{uuid}/data?offset=&limit=`
- Frontend constant: `MCA_COMPANY_MASTER_RESOURCE_ID` in `dataset.models.ts`

Sample limit (1000) ≠ portal total — document UX accordingly when changing aggregation.
